hich included 17 points and 5 assists, was just a glimpse of what was to come.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"Over the course of the 1998-1999 season, Aldo would go on to establish himself as a force to be reckoned with in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"But what exactly does it mean to play in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league?\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"For starters, it means competing against the best of the best in college basketball.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"The NCAA, or National Collegiate Athletic Association, is the governing body for college athletics in the United States, and its Division I is the highest level of competition.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"To be eligible to play in the NCAA Division I, a university must meet strict criteria, including a minimum number of athletic scholarships, a certain level of athletic budget, and a commitment to academic excellence.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"Troy University, where Aldo played, is a member of the NCAA Division I and the Sun Belt Conference.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"As a Division I school, Troy is required to adhere to the NCAA's strict rules and regulations, including those related to recruiting, eligibility, and athletic aid.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"This means that Aldo, as a student-athlete at Troy, was subject to rigorous academic standards, including maintaining a minimum GPA and completing a certain number of credit hours each semester.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"Throughout the 1998-1999 season, Aldo's impressive stats and clutch performances earned him recognition not only from his coaches and teammates but also from the NCAA itself.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"He was named to the Sun Belt Conference All-Freshman Team, a testament to his hard work and dedication to the sport.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"But Aldo's success on the court was not limited to individual accolades.\"}]